    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733620/extras/d599287684a8e7b0adaf15f65e66c823.avif?t=1753514328\" /></div><br>Kaori is a good girl who always does the right thing. But one day, succumbed to temptation, she stole panties in the Mall... <br>She found herself in an eerie place, similar to the crime scene. Everything is against her here, but she meets a young girl named Akari. The new friend claims that she knows how to get out of this place. And for this, you need to steal panties again!<br><br>Cursed Pantsu is a story-driven action-adventure game with RPG and platforming elements about Kaori\u2019s adventures in the Hellish Mall.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733620/extras/68b0e21465812d0bf859f874d63164bf.avif?t=1753514328\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Creepy atmosphere of surreal Hellish Mall full of dangers and secrets. <br></li><li>Charming saleswomen are ready to serve or to kill you. You need panties. Strip off their clothes to get it!<br></li><li>Collect cloth and defeat enemies to become stronger and learn new abilities.<br></li><li>Solve the pantsu-thievery mystery!<br></li><li>Money is power here. Literally, use the money to defeat your enemies.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733620/extras/c6903da1cdc08d247593b160d1ee38c9.poster.avif?t=1753514328\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733620/extras/c6903da1cdc08d247593b160d1ee38c9.webm?t=1753514328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1733620/extras/c6903da1cdc08d247593b160d1ee38c9.mp4?t=1753514328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video